> 
> David Cairns wrote:
> >
> >     Hi,
> >     Could someone please direct me to a diagram of the switch settings
> > to change the frequency of the CPU on a Digital PWS 433a. All of the
> > documents you can find on Compaq's site show the same configuration: 433
> > Mhz. I have a 500 Mhz 21164 I'd like to drop in it but I can't find the
> > switch settings anywhere.
> >     Thanks,
> >     Dave


The switches control 2 things, the bus speed of the mainboard and a
multiplication factor for the processor. 

For the 433 the bus speed is 433 / 7 = 61.9 MHz
For the 500 the bus speed is 500 / 8 = 62.5 MHz
For the 600 the bus speed is 600 / 9 = 66.6 MHz

Regards,

Dirk



