Yes, if a 300XL is the same as a 300, then it uses a "Keyboard/mouse extension
cable with connector block". The keyboard and the mouse plug into separate
sockets on the connector block. The 15-pin port on the back of the system
unit is a combined "Keyboard/Mouse or Tablet Port" and the connector block
cable plugs into this.
